          color="white"
        >
          <h2
            style="
              padding-bottom: 8px;
              color: #4d3060;
              text-align: left;
              border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;

              font-size: 26px;
              line-height: 1.2;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Cuba’s energy crisis has deepened after Energy Minister Vicente de la O Levy said the country has run out of diesel and fuel oil. </strong>A Russian oil donation from late March has already been exhausted, leaving the island’s weak electrical grid in a critical state. Parts of Havana are experiencing blackouts lasting 20-22 hours a day, forcing residents to cook, do laundry, and charge phones during brief periods of power (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/05/13/americas/cuba-russia-energy-crisis-intl-hnk" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">power panic</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Russian President Vladimir Putin said the Sarmat intercontinental ballistic missile, known by NATO as “Satan II,” </strong>will be ready for combat duty by the end of the year after a successful test. The missile can reportedly fly more than 10,000 km and carry up to 16 independently targeted nuclear warheads. Sarmat is meant to replace Russia’s Soviet-era SS-18 missile but has faced years of delays and failed tests (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/05/13/europe/putin-test-powerful-russian-nuclear-missile-intl" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Sarmat signal</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>China renewed export licenses for US beef processing plants, allowing them to regain eligibility to sell beef to China.</strong> More than 400 plants had lost their gateway over the past year after permissions granted between 2020 and 2021 expired without renewal. The move came as President Trump and Chinese President Xi Jinping met in Beijing, suggesting a possible goodwill gesture ahead of trade talks (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/other/china-renews-licences-for-hundreds-of-us-beef-exporters-amid-trump-xi-summit/ar-AA23a8rH?ocid=BingNewsSerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">trade thaw</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang and his wife, Lori, are using their foundation to acquire computing time from CoreWeave and donate it to universities and nonprofit institutes. </strong>A filing valued the donation at $108.3M so far, with the resources meant for science and AI research. Nvidia also plans to provide engineering support to some recipients. Nvidia invested $2B in the AI cloud company and signed a $6.3B capacity agreement (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-ca/money/technology/nvidia-ceo-s-foundation-buys-108-million-of-ai-computing-from-coreweave-donates-it-to-researchers/ar-AA238dYz?ocid=BingNewsSerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">GPU grants</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Apple warned the EU that draft measures forcing Google to allow Android to rival AI services could create privacy, security, and safety risks.</strong> The proposals are intended to help Google comply with the Digital Markets bill and would allow competing AI tools to interact with Android apps to perform tasks such as sending emails, ordering food, or sharing photos. Apple said the risks are especially severe because AI systems are evolving quickly and remain unpredictable (<a href="https://www.newsbytesapp.com/news/science/apple-warns-eu-s-google-ai-access-proposal-risks-user-safety/story" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Apple alarm</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Notion launched a Developer Platform to move beyond note-taking and become a hub for AI agents, workflows, and live business data. </strong>The platform introduces Workers, a cloud-based environment where teams can run custom code, sync external databases, trigger workflows, and build agent tools without managing their own infrastructure. Notion will also let users connect external AI agents such as Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and Decagon, assign them work, and track their progress within Notion (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/13/notion-just-turned-its-workspace-into-a-hub-for-ai-agents/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">workflow hub</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Macquarie Island, a remote UNESCO World Heritage site between Tasmania and Antarctica, is getting much wetter as Southern Ocean storms intensify. </strong>A study found annual rainfall on the island has risen 28% since 1979, adding about 260mm of rain each year. Scientists say the increase is not mainly due to more storms, but to storms releasing more rain when they arrive. The change is making parts of the island wetter and boggier, damaging native megaherbs and reshaping ecosystems (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/05/260512202337.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">ocean sweats</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">OpenAI says no user data was stolen after the employee's device hack (<a href="https://www.livemint.com/news/world/openai-says-no-user-data-stolen-after-supply-chain-hackers-accessed-employee-devices-11778735895589.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">data safe</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">The US House allows year-round trade of E15 gasoline (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/general/us-house-passes-bill-allowing-year-round-sales-of-e15-gasoline/ar-AA238AXv?ocid=BingNewsSerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">fuel flex</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Honda just had its worst year ever (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/companies/honda-just-had-its-worst-year-ever/ar-AA239SDz?ocid=BingNewsSerp&amp;cvid=6a05ca84bdb34c69b27d0d55d816060e&amp;cvpid=6a05cae1cc39430bb5b5c1e852163664&amp;ei=23" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">record slump</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Trump issued a visa change for foreign World Cup fans (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/world/trump-just-issued-a-major-visa-change-for-foreign-world-cup-fans/ar-AA237UtD?ocid=BingNewsSerp&amp;cvid=6a05ca84bdb34c69b27d0d55d816060e&amp;cvpid=6a05cae1cc39430bb5b5c1e852163664&amp;ei=31" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">ease of entry</a>).</p>
</mj-text>

